# CaiRobot MVP .gitignore

## IDE / Editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/

## Node.js
node_modules/
dist/
.next/

## Go
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
*.prof

## Tabbit / TRAE 原始导出收件箱（inbox 不入库，保留 README 和目录结构）
docs/tabbit/inbox/**/*
docs/trae-export/inbox/**/*
!docs/tabbit/inbox/**/.gitkeep
!docs/trae-export/inbox/**/.gitkeep

## 临时文件
tmp/
docs/drafts/
